# Master branch workflow

- Perform all RockServer implementation, test, documentation, and configuration changes directly on `master`.
- Do not create or use feature branches or detached-HEAD commits for this repository unless the user explicitly overrides this rule.
- Before editing, verify that the active worktree is on `master`; if it is not, move the work to the primary `master` worktree before making changes.
